  "goodToKnow": "Wieso means why, a casual synonym of warum: Wieso nicht? (Why not?), Wieso denn? (How come?). It's very common in speech, while weshalb is more formal. The theme song of the German Sesame Street (Sesamstraße) famously celebrates question words like wieso, encouraging children to always ask. Wieso eigentlich? means 'Why, actually?'"
